font-weight:bold;font-size:22.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:22.0000pt;" ><font face="宋体" >实验报告：</font>SM3 密码杂凑算法 SIMD 优化实现</span></b><b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(31,78,121);
font-weight:bold;font-size:22.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:22.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></b></h1><p class=MsoNormal  style="margin-top:8.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:8.0000pt;
margin-left:0.0000pt;border-top:1.0000pt solid rgb(217,226,243);mso-border-top-alt:0.5000pt solid rgb(217,226,243);
padding:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt ;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;mso-line-height-alt:12pt;" ><hr size="3"  width="100%"  align=center ></p><h2 style="mso-pagination:widow-orphan;mso-line-height-alt:12pt;" ><b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(46,117,182);
font-weight:bold;font-size:16.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face="宋体" >一、实验目的</font></span></b><b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(46,117,182);
font-weight:bold;font-size:16.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></b></h2><p class=p  style="mso-pagination:widow-orphan;mso-line-height-alt:12pt;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(51,51,51);
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >1. 实现 SM3 密码杂凑算法（GM/T 0004-2012 标准）的纯 C 参考版本</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=p  style="mso-pagination:widow-orphan;mso-line-height-alt:12pt;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(51,51,51);
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >2. 基于 SIMD 寄存器与通用寄存器混合策略，完成 SM3 算法的并行优化</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=p  style="mso-pagination:widow-orphan;mso-line-height-alt:12pt;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(51,51,51);
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >3. 分别在 </span><b><span class="16"  style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(31,78,121);
font-weight:bold;" >ARM64 NEON</span></b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(51,51,51);
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >&nbsp;<font face="微软雅黑" >和</font> </span><b><span class="16"  style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(31,78,121);
font-weight:bold;" >x86 AVX2/AVX-512</span></b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(51,51,51);
