font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >&nbsp;<font face="微软雅黑" >向量，每条</font> lane 处理一条独立消息</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=p  style="mso-pagination:widow-orphan;mso-line-height-alt:12pt;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(51,51,51);
