font-size:10.0000pt;background:rgb(242,242,242);mso-shading:rgb(242,242,242);" >vbslq_u32(x, y, z)</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(51,51,51);
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >&nbsp;— 位选择指令，单指令实现 GG1 选择函数</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;
