mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><h3 style="mso-pagination:widow-orphan;mso-line-height-alt:12pt;" ><b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(46,117,182);
font-weight:bold;font-size:13.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >Bug 1: SM3_TJ_ROTL 预计算表进位丢失</span></b><b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(46,117,182);
font-weight:bold;font-size:13.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></b></h3><p class=p  style="mso-pagination:widow-orphan;mso-line-height-alt:12pt;" ><b><span class="16"  style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(31,78,121);
font-weight:bold;" ><font face="微软雅黑" >现象</font></span></b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(51,51,51);
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face="微软雅黑" >：所有标准测试向量全部失败，摘要与预期完全不同。</font></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=p  style="mso-pagination:widow-orphan;mso-line-height-alt:12pt;" ><b><span class="16"  style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(31,78,121);
font-weight:bold;" ><font face="微软雅黑" >定位</font></span></b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(51,51,51);
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face="微软雅黑" >：</font>Round 0 和 Round 1 的中间值与正确结果一致，但从某个中间轮开始累积偏离。逐轮对比后发现在 </span><span class="15"  style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:Consolas;color:rgb(51,51,51);
font-size:10.0000pt;background:rgb(242,242,242);mso-shading:rgb(242,242,242);" >TJ_ROTL[2] = ROTL32(0x79CC4519, 2) = 0xE7311465</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(51,51,51);
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face="微软雅黑" >，但表中存储为</font> </span><span class="15"  style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:Consolas;color:rgb(51,51,51);
font-size:10.0000pt;background:rgb(242,242,242);mso-shading:rgb(242,242,242);" >0xE7311464</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(51,51,51);
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face="微软雅黑" >，缺少最低比特的进位。</font></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=p  style="mso-pagination:widow-orphan;mso-line-height-alt:12pt;" ><b><span class="16"  style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(31,78,121);
font-weight:bold;" ><font face="微软雅黑" >根因</font></span></b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(51,51,51);
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face="微软雅黑" >：预计算表在生成时只做了左移操作（</font></span><span class="15"  style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:Consolas;color:rgb(51,51,51);
font-size:10.0000pt;background:rgb(242,242,242);mso-shading:rgb(242,242,242);" >x &lt;&lt; j</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(51,51,51);
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face="微软雅黑" >），未处理移出高位字的比特应</font> wrap-around 到低位，即未执行 </span><span class="15"  style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:Consolas;color:rgb(51,51,51);
font-size:10.0000pt;background:rgb(242,242,242);mso-shading:rgb(242,242,242);" >(x &lt;&lt; j) | (x &gt;&gt; (32 - j))</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(51,51,51);
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >&nbsp;<font face="微软雅黑" >的循环左移。</font></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=p  style="mso-pagination:widow-orphan;mso-line-height-alt:12pt;" ><b><span class="16"  style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(31,78,121);
font-weight:bold;" ><font face="微软雅黑" >修复</font></span></b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(51,51,51);
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face="微软雅黑" >：删除整个预计算表</font> </span><span class="15"  style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:Consolas;color:rgb(51,51,51);
font-size:10.0000pt;background:rgb(242,242,242);mso-shading:rgb(242,242,242);" >SM3_TJ_ROTL[64]</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(51,51,51);
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face="微软雅黑" >，改为在每轮循环内动态计算：</font></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=pre  style="mso-pagination:widow-orphan;mso-line-height-alt:12pt;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:Consolas;color:rgb(51,51,51);
font-size:9.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >// 修复前</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:Consolas;color:rgb(51,51,51);
font-size:9.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=pre  style="mso-pagination:widow-orphan;mso-line-height-alt:12pt;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:Consolas;color:rgb(51,51,51);
font-size:9.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >SS1 = ROTL32(ROTL32(A, 12) + E + SM3_TJ_ROTL[j], 7); &nbsp;// &#10060; 预计算表有误</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:Consolas;color:rgb(51,51,51);
font-size:9.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=pre  style="mso-pagination:widow-orphan;mso-line-height-alt:12pt;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:Consolas;color:rgb(51,51,51);
font-size:9.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p class=pre  style="mso-pagination:widow-orphan;mso-line-height-alt:12pt;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:Consolas;color:rgb(51,51,51);
