font-weight:bold;font-size:13.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >Bug 3: 批处理循环只处理前 N 条消息</span></b><b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(46,117,182);
font-weight:bold;font-size:13.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></b></h3><p class=p  style="mso-pagination:widow-orphan;mso-line-height-alt:12pt;" ><b><span class="16"  style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(31,78,121);
font-weight:bold;" ><font face="微软雅黑" >现象</font></span></b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(51,51,51);
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face="微软雅黑" >：交叉验证中消息</font> 0-7 正确（AVX2 第一批），但消息 8-31 的 SIMD 输出等于初始向量 IV，说明压缩函数从未执行。</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=p  style="mso-pagination:widow-orphan;mso-line-height-alt:12pt;" ><b><span class="16"  style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(31,78,121);
font-weight:bold;" ><font face="微软雅黑" >根因</font></span></b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(51,51,51);
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face="微软雅黑" >：批处理循环的内层</font> </span><span class="15"  style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:Consolas;color:rgb(51,51,51);
font-size:10.0000pt;background:rgb(242,242,242);mso-shading:rgb(242,242,242);" >for</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(51,51,51);
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >&nbsp;<font face="微软雅黑" >只遍历了消息索引</font> </span><span class="15"  style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:Consolas;color:rgb(51,51,51);
font-size:10.0000pt;background:rgb(242,242,242);mso-shading:rgb(242,242,242);" >0..n</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(51,51,51);
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >&nbsp;<font face="微软雅黑" >一次，当</font> </span><span class="15"  style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:Consolas;color:rgb(51,51,51);
font-size:10.0000pt;background:rgb(242,242,242);mso-shading:rgb(242,242,242);" >n=32 &gt; batch_size=8</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(51,51,51);
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >&nbsp;<font face="微软雅黑" >时，超出第一批的消息永远不会被处理。</font></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=p  style="mso-pagination:widow-orphan;mso-line-height-alt:12pt;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(51,51,51);
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face="微软雅黑" >原代码：</font></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;
