font-weight:bold;font-size:13.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >9.2 关键技术收获</span></b><b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(46,117,182);
font-weight:bold;font-size:13.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></b></h3><p class=p  style="mso-pagination:widow-orphan;mso-line-height-alt:12pt;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(51,51,51);
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >1. </span><b><span class="16"  style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(31,78,121);
font-weight:bold;" >SIMD + GPR 混合策略</span></b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(51,51,51);
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face="微软雅黑" >：将密集运算分配给</font> SIMD 向量寄存器，将循环控制和条件分支保留在通用寄存器中，是密码学算法并行化的通用范式</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=p  style="mso-pagination:widow-orphan;mso-line-height-alt:12pt;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(51,51,51);
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >2. </span><b><span class="16"  style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(31,78,121);
font-weight:bold;" >AVX-512 </span></b><span class="15"  style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:Consolas;color:rgb(31,78,121);
font-size:10.0000pt;background:rgb(242,242,242);mso-shading:rgb(242,242,242);" >_mm512_ternarylogic_epi32</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(51,51,51);
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face="微软雅黑" >：单指令实现任意三输入布尔函数，将</font> SM3 轮函数中的 FF/GG/P0/P1 从 4 条位运算压缩为 1 条，同时消除了中间临时变量</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=p  style="mso-pagination:widow-orphan;mso-line-height-alt:12pt;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(51,51,51);
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >3. </span><b><span class="16"  style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(31,78,121);
font-weight:bold;" ><font face="微软雅黑" >预计算表的陷阱</font></span></b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(51,51,51);
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face="微软雅黑" >：看似提升性能的查表优化，如果生成有误会导致全量错误。运行时动态计算在正确性和</font> O3 编译器优化的加持下，代价可忽略</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=p  style="mso-pagination:widow-orphan;mso-line-height-alt:12pt;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(51,51,51);
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >4. </span><b><span class="16"  style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(31,78,121);
font-weight:bold;" ><font face="微软雅黑" >批处理范式的边界条件</font></span></b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(51,51,51);
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face="微软雅黑" >：</font>SIMD 批处理需要正确分片——外层 cursor 持续推进行进程索引，内层填满一轮 batch，两层的 </span><span class="15"  style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:Consolas;color:rgb(51,51,51);
font-size:10.0000pt;background:rgb(242,242,242);mso-shading:rgb(242,242,242);" >while</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(51,51,51);
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >&nbsp;<font face="微软雅黑" >确保不漏掉任何消息</font></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><h3 style="mso-pagination:widow-orphan;mso-line-height-alt:12pt;" ><b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(46,117,182);
